cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TRI-X: A Framework for Triage, TiTrATE Reasoning, Safety Governance, and Transparent Decision Support"
abstract: >-
  A framework-level package for clinical decision support that estimates triage
  risk, applies TiTrATE dizziness reasoning, enforces safety-governance and
  audit logic, and produces transparent, explainable decisions. All reported
  metrics are computed on a synthetic cohort by a deterministic seed-42 driver
  (scripts/run_all.py) and reproduce byte-for-byte, with figures rendered from
  the computed results.
